  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Natural polymers<br />These polymers are found in plants and animals. Examples are proteins, cellulose, starch, some resins and rubber.</p><p>Semi synthetic polymers are those polymers that are prepared by chemically treating natural polymers. Rayon is a regenerated cellulosic fibre. So, Rayon is semisynthetic polymer.</p></blockquote>",
